{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Adventure Awaits Beneath the Earth. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Uncover the lost secrets of an ancient civilization in <strong>Loded Depths</strong>, a mining and exploration RPG where danger and discovery are buried together. Brave treacherous biomes, battle monstrous guardians, gather rare resources, and forge your path deep into the unknown.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong> </h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore Vast Biomes:</strong> Journey through caverns, sprawling forests, marshy swamps, jungle ruins, volcanic caverns, and the unforgiving tundra \u2014 each filled with secrets, resources, and powerful enemies. </p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Battle Monstrous Bosses:</strong> Face off against terrifying guardians of the city's deepest mysteries.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Mine, Craft, and Build:</strong> Harvest unique resources from every biome to craft powerful tools, construct your expedition base, and survive the wilds. </p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Solve Ancient Mysteries:</strong> Unravel the story of the city \u2014 a civilization swallowed by the earth \u2014 and uncover technology lost to time. </p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Survive and Thrive:</strong> Upgrade your equipment, tame the hostile environments, and turn the dangers of the depths into your greatest strengths.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Gameplay Overview:</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As a lone researcher following the legends of a pulsing crystal, you embark on a dangerous expedition into a world reclaimed by nature and time. Dig through crumbling tunnels, gather powerful resources, and unlock ancient technology to survive deadly biomes and fearsome bosses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i><strong>Every descent brings you closer to the truth\u2026 and to the power that lies beneath. Will you survive the depths \u2014 or be lost to them?</strong></i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Add Loded Depths to your wishlist today, prepare to face the depths!</strong><br>  </p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3059000?t=1761232584","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3059000?t=1761232584","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3059000/1ddf96589ed75f761aa318bdcd2e32496f219ab5/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1761232584","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3059000/1ddf96589ed75f761aa318bdcd2e32496f219ab5/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1761232584","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3835640,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Adventure Awaits Beneath the Earth. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Uncover the lost secrets of an ancient civilization in <strong>Loded Depths</strong>, a mining and exploration RPG where danger and discovery are buried together. Brave treacherous biomes, battle monstrous guardians, gather rare resources, and forge your path deep into the unknown.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong> </h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore Vast Biomes:</strong> Jour